<p>Fire bone spears in all directions, hitting all foes within radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">108, 146, 175, 200, 222</acronym> physical damage, and inflicting bleeding for another <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">54, 73, 88, 100, 111</acronym> damage over 5 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>